[00:22.02]1. We live in a world that is wayward and lost;
[00:26.38]The way of our God is not known.
[00:30.66]We need sure direction to safeguard our steps;
[00:34.66]We cannot succeed on our own.
[00:39.12]Our meetings refresh us and brighten our hope;
[00:43.50]They help us build faith in our God.
[00:47.78]They move us with words that incite to fine deeds,
[00:52.54]They give us the strength to go on.
[00:56.52]We’ll never forsake what Jehovah commands;
[01:01.16]His will is what we want to do.
[01:05.28]Our meetings instruct us in ways that are right;
[01:09.78]Our love for the truth they renew.
[01:23.38]2. Jehovah is keenly aware of our needs;
[01:27.64]His counsel by us should be heard.
[01:31.58]To buy out the time for occasions to meet
[01:35.96]Shows wisdom and trust in his Word.
[01:40.28]By wholesome instruction from God-fearing men,
[01:44.54]We learn how our faith can be shown.
[01:48.96]With loving support from our fam’ly of faith,
[01:53.50]We know that we’re never alone.
[01:58.08]So as we look forward to much better times,
[02:02.24]We’ll meet with the ones whom we love.
[02:06.38]And here at these meetings we’ll learn how to live
[02:10.74]With wisdom that comes from above.
